  "agent": "holmes-native",
  "artifact_text": "### Observations\n1. Pod events for `orders-api-7b7dfdc66d-s2556` record readiness probe failures with `HTTP probe failed with statuscode: 503`.\n2. Container logs for `orders-api-7b7dfdc66d-s2556` repeatedly report `database orders-db-primary.demo-apps.svc:5432 not reachable ([Errno -2] Name or service not known)`.\n3. Deployment record `CI-2459` modified `DB_HOST` to `orders-db-primary.demo-apps.svc:5432`, but namespace `demo-apps` contains only Service `orders-db`.\n\n### Ruled-Out Leads\n1. Pod crash looping was ruled out because container status is `Running` with zero restarts and passing `/healthz` liveness probes.\n2. Memory exhaustion was ruled out because container status reports zero termination events and usage is well below the 256Mi limit.\n\n### Root Cause\nConfigMap `orders-config` configures `DB_HOST` with a non-existent service hostname ahead of an uncompleted database migration, causing TCP readiness checks to fail.\n\n### Recommended Action\nThe orders team must revert `DB_HOST` in ConfigMap `orders-config` back to `orders-db.demo-apps.svc:5432` per runbook `RB-010`.",
